<title>SWAZILAND: Golf-Royal Swazi Open final round scores.</title>
<headline>Golf-Royal Swazi Open final round scores.</headline>
<dateline>MBABANE 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading fourth and final round scores in the 500 000 rand (113 400 dollars) Royal Swazi Open golf tournament at the par-72 Royal Swazi Golf Club near Mbabane on Sunday (South African unless stated):</p>
<p>269 Warrick Druian 70 64 65 70</p>
<p>270 Nic Henning 66 66 69 69, Chris Davison 67 67 69 67</p>
<p>272 Michael Scholz 71 70 67 64, Bobby Lincoln 72 67 68 65</p>
<p>273 Pelop Panagopoulos 67 72 67 67, Derek Crawford (Scotland) 71 70 64 68</p>
<p>274 Tjaart van der Walt 69 66 70 69</p>
<p>275 Desvonde Botes 63 73 69 70</p>
<p>276 Ashley Roestoff 73 68 68 67, Craig Kamps 73 65 68 70</p>
<p>277 Callie Swart 66 69 71 71, Wayne Bradley 71 68 67 71</p>
<p>278 Marco Gortana 70 69 71 68, Des Terblanche 71 67 71 69, Brad Ott (U.S.) 69 68 69 72, Justin Hobday 66 71 69 72</p>
<p>279 Fran Quinn junior (U.S.) 69 72 70 68, Mark Murless 71 65 73 70, Bradford Vaughan 69 71 69 70, Alan McLean 70 70 68 71 (gone sport) (Mark Stokes: press centre 09268 62533/evenings 09268 61101 x 338)</p>
